 "titulo": "You built an outhouse 🚽 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "YOU BUILT AN OUTHOUSE",
 "descripcion": "From a stinky hole to a pit latrine that doesn't smell, doesn't attract flies and doesn't poison your well, one problem at a time.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #outhouse #toilet #offgrid #shorts",
